<title>PAKISTAN: Port condition update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port condition update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Karachi, Dec 19 - Ten vessels waiting off port. Three general cargo vessels waiting up to three days, three container vessels waiting up to two days and four fertiliser vessels waiting up to eight days. Four vessels are laid up off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
